sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant T as 双脚 Tracker (SteamVR/PICO)
  participant RT as OpenXR Runtime (SteamVR)
  participant UA as OpenXR::UpdateActions()
  participant IN as m_input (atomic)
  participant CI as hook_InjectXRInput()
  participant AN as LegMotionAnalyzer
  participant VP as VPADStatus
  participant G as BotW 角色控制器

  Note over T,RT: ALVR PICO4 emulation → tracker 角色 Left/Right Foot
  RT->>UA: xrSyncActions(gameplay_fps) + xrLocateSpace(footSpaces, m_stageSpace)
  UA->>UA: locatePose(foot) 复用 lambda（仅参数化 subactionPath）
  UA->>IN: Shared.footPoseLocation[2] / footPoseVelocity[2] / footPose[2]
  IN->>CI: load()（含双脚位姿 + 头显位姿 renderer->GetMiddlePose）

  CI->>CI: 死区 applied (controls.cpp ~1090-1096)
  CI->>AN: Update(footLoc, footVel, footActive, hmdPos, hmdYaw, dt, cfg)
  AN->>AN: DetectGaitCycle → 支撑/摆动相位、步频、步幅
  AN->>AN: ComputeMovementVector → yaw 旋转 + EMA + 死区 + 增益
  AN->>AN: isRun / isCrouch / isJump 状态机 + 冷却 + 滞回
  AN-->>CI: LegMotionResult{walkVector, isRun, isCrouch, isJump, gait}

  CI->>VP: leftStickSource.currentState += walkVector（死区之后 / processJoystickInput 之前）
  CI->>VP: newXRBtnHold |= VPAD_BUTTON_X (jump)
  CI->>VP: newXRBtnHold |= VPAD_BUTTON_B (run)
  CI->>VP: newXRBtnHold |= VPAD_BUTTON_STICK_L (crouch)
  CI->>VP: processJoystickInput() 转成 VPAD_STICK_L_EMULATION_*
  VP->>G: writeMemory → 游戏读取摇杆/按键 → 虚拟角色移动
